Register-to-packet mapping: **D1→T18; D2→T24; D3→T22–T23; D4→T24; D5→T25; D6→T17; D7/D10→T21; D8→T19; D9→T20.** P0-5's two callerless controls have their own T34 disposition after the identity design packets.

